  "body_html": "<h1>skew_optimal</h1>\n<h2>Lean type</h2>\n<p><code>lean\ntheorem skew_optimal {K : Type*} [Fintype K] [DecidableEq K] [Nonempty K] (S : K → K → 𝕜) (hS : ∀ k l, S k l = - S l k) : ∃ z : K → 𝕜, (∀ k, 0 ≤ z k) ∧ (∑ k, z k = 1) ∧ (∀ l, 0 ≤ ∑ k, z k * S k l)</code></p>\n<h2>Dependencies</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>IsPositiveAffineOf.symm</li>\n<li>Indifferent.symm</li>\n</ul>",
